{"id":"099cf53ea18ee2a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-kurepa-tree.md","title":"Kurepa Tree","display":"thm-kurepa-tree — Kurepa Tree","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-kurepa-tree","aliases":["58-thm-kurepa-tree"],"display":"thm-kurepa-tree — Kurepa Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-kurepa-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-kurepa-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kurepa-tree — Kurepa Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8519e320aac8e03\" href=\"?note=a8519e320aac8e03\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md\">../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,&lt;_{T},b\\in V\">\\(T,&lt;_{T},b\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (Kurepa-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8519e320aac8e03\" href=\"?note=a8519e320aac8e03\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md\">../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Branches}(T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)\">\\(\\operatorname{Branches}(T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)\\)</span> is the set of cofinal branches of order type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> used by the upstream Kurepa-tree definition</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)\n\\to\n|\\operatorname{Branches}(T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)|\\geq\\omega_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)\n\\to\n|\\operatorname{Branches}(T,&lt;_{T},\\omega_1)|\\geq\\omega_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The conclusion is the cardinal consequence of having more than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> cofinal branches.</li>\n<li>No unconditional existence claim is made: Kurepa-tree existence is independent of ZFC (and the consistency of nonexistence has additional strength).</li>\n<li>The tree order is explicit, matching the three-argument upstream predicate and its definition of cofinal branches.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8519e320aac8e03","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8519e320aac8e03","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (Kurepa-tree predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-kurepa-tree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,<_{T},b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Branches}(T,<_{T},\\omega_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kurepa\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KurepaTree}_S(T,<_{T},\\omega_1)\n\\to\n|\\operatorname{Branches}(T,<_{T},\\omega_1)|\\geq\\omega_2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1144,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4264","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-kurepa-tree.md|58-thm-kurepa-tree]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a8519e320aac8e03","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}